房租！要不是看你开车开得不错的份上，我他吗刚才就一刀子捅死你！滚开！”方脸怒喝了声，说完又要走。林飞不乐意了，再度把他们拦住，皱眉道：“你们也别唬我，到底给不给钱？”“哟呵，怎么，还生气了？你是脑子哪根筋断了？真以为我们兄弟俩不敢杀人？”那方脸再度掏出匕首，灵活地转了个刀花，森然道：“实话告诉你，要钱没有，我数到三，你要知趣就滚蛋，不然就白刀子进，红刀子出。”林飞的脸色很平静，好似根本没听到什么威胁，只是显得有些无奈的样子，别着嘴不吭声。“一……二……”大汉见林飞依然不肯走开，终于杀机毕露，刀子手上一紧，直戳向林飞的心口！“三！去死！！”就当大汉以为刀子会如过去一样，刺入人胸膛的时候，突然自己的右手手腕被一根手指猛地点了一下。手腕如遭电击，手掌松开，刀子落下的同时，被林飞的左手恰好接到。这一切发生在眨眼之间，两个大汉都压根没看清怎么回事，就发现刀子落在了林飞手上。方脸更是捂着自己的手腕，疼得直龇牙。林飞将刀子随手往远边的工地一扔，又一次面无表情地把手伸向大汉。“我看还是我来数吧，我数到三，你们不给钱，我就自己动手掏你们口袋了”。俩大汉对视了一眼，眼里都露出一丝恐惧，他们不是白痴，也在道上见过一些高手，刚才林飞的速度和手段，绝对不是一个普通出租司机该有的！“一……二……”两名大汉眼神交流了下，都觉得多一事不如少一事，两人没必要为了点小钱，耽误主子交待的正事。“给！我们给！”那方脸大汉往自己口袋里一掏，摸出几张皱巴巴的零钱。林飞再度露出了一个人畜无害的笑脸，“哎呀，早点这样不就好了么，大家都是出来混口饭吃的，没必要闹得不愉快么……”说着笑眯眯地接过了钱，清点起来。“这里只有一百二啊，还差八百八呢”，林飞目光又望向后面那光头。光头用空着的那只手摸了摸，摇摇头道：“我没带钱。”方脸道：“这位……朋友，要不先欠着，以后再给你剩下的钱？”“这哪行，你听过出租车还赊账的么？”“那怎么办”，光头不耐烦地道。林飞眯了眯眼，目光瞄向了那光头胸口的一串银项链，说：“那是银的吧？要不拿那个抵押在我这儿？或者钱不要了，你们把那项链给我。”光头脸色涨红，愤怒道：“你别欺人太甚！别以为我们真怕了你！”“怎么又发火了……我这不是在跟你们商量么”，林飞嘀咕道。“这位小哥，我们的忍耐是有极限的，你再这么耽误我们的时间，休怪我们跟你拼命”，方脸恫吓道。林飞却并没被吓住的意思，有点难办地继续打量这俩大汉，“真不肯给项链？那有别的值钱货色么？名牌腰带？哎，对了，你那耳钉是金的还是银的……”两个大汉心里的怒火急剧上升，他们感觉林飞像是在盯着俩不会还手的死人，想从死人身上剥好东西一般。“欺人太甚！忠哥，咱一起弄死他！”光头怒火熊熊，将麻袋往地上一放，捏着拳头，抖擞着肌肉，全身骨骼如爆豆子般噼啪作响。方脸也已经忍耐到了极限，他们道上混的，要是被人蹬鼻子上脸都忍气吞声，那就甭混了！何况对方只是一个出租司机，就算练过一些功夫，那也未必是他们联手的对手！见两人捏着拳头就要冲上来，林飞有些头疼地道：“怎么又要动手了，有话好好说啊。”“去见阎王爷说吧！”那方脸大汉冲上来就是一脚猛踢！林飞脚步轻挪地闪开，三根手指在大汉的小腿侧一拍，大汉发出一声惨叫，小腿像是被什么重物给锤了一下，要裂开一般！而那光头这时乘机绕到林飞背后，一个肘击试图捶在林飞的后颈部位。可林飞的肩一低，好似背后长眼，轻描淡写地伸手往后面接住了那一肘子，顺势往前一拽，又用肩膀向上一顶！“嗷！”光头发出杀猪般的惨叫，他的胳膊肘被愣生生给顶断了！俩大汉一个无法站稳，一个废了条手，只不过才三秒不到的时间。两人惊恐地看着林飞，简直不敢相信，他们竟然就如此轻易被一个出租司机给打地跟白痴一样！“最后问一次，给不给项链”，林飞这回也不客气了，张口就强要。方脸对光头使了个眼色，示意他暂时保命要紧。光头无奈，只好把银项链摘下，交到了林飞手上。心里则是不停滴血，简直倒血霉！大半夜办点事还出乱子，中途坐个出租车逃跑，结果让出租车司机给敲诈了！林飞立马笑嘻嘻地拿过，还掂了掂分量，这下算赚了，虽然麻烦了点，但至少房租应该可以交了。“这位朋友，我们兄弟俩技不如人，这下可以走了吧”，方脸忍着怒气，尽量平和地问道。林飞手一挥，“走吧。”二人松了口气，转身打算去拿那麻袋，虽然受伤了，但还是得硬撑着。可就在两人转身的刹那，林飞的眼里陡然闪过一抹无情的寒芒，脸上的笑意也烟消云散。他的两只手，如同鬼爪一般，伸向了两名大汉的后脑勺……“呃……”“呃……”两名大汉都没反应过来，皆是闷哼了两声，后脑部被林飞的手指像是啄了一下，就晕阙了过去。林飞踢了踢不醒人事的两个大个子，叹息道：“不动手倒也罢了，动了手，总不能让你们泄露出风声去。”自言自语地说了句，林飞走向那只地上的麻袋。犹豫了下，林飞还是把麻袋口的绳子给解开，敞开了袋子口。一股栀子味的芬芳混着一股酒精的味道，散发了出来。等看清了里面装着的“东西”，林飞眼里闪过“果然如此”的神色。里面，是一个女人！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/nuzongcaideshenjibaobiao/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 0002 The two big men with gold and silver earrings were stunned, and then they said with a ferocious smile on their square faces: \"Boy, are you blind, or have your brain been crushed by a wheel? Didn't you realize that we two brothers were gangsters on the road?\" \"No matter which road you are on, you still have to pay for taking a taxi, a total of two One hundred and seventy-five, and I just ran at least three red lights, and the fine for being photographed is at least more than 800 yuan. It adds up to just over a thousand yuan, just a fraction, I'll give you a thousand yuan, what do you think, I think that's enough.\" Lin Fei patted his chest generously. The two big men laughed angrily and said with a bald head: \"You are really evil. You are lucky that our brothers did not rob you. How dare you come to blackmail us!?\" \"This is the income from labor. How can you call it robbery? Please help me. It is not easy for ordinary people to drive all night. I am still struggling to pay the rent this month.\" Lin Fei still said with a kind smile. \"Who cares about your rent! If I hadn't seen you driving well, I would have stabbed you to death just now! Get out of here!\" Fang Lian shouted angrily, and then left again. Lin Fei was unhappy and stopped them again. He frowned and said, \"Don't bluff me. Are you going to pay me or not?\" \"Oh, why are you still angry? Have you broken a muscle in your brain? Do you really think we two brothers don't dare to kill people?\" The square-faced man took out the dagger again and turned it around flexibly. He said solemnly: \"To tell you the truth, if you want money, I will count to three. If you want to know better, get out, otherwise the white knife will go in and the red knife will come out.\" Lin Fei's face was very calm, as if he had not heard any threats at all, but he looked helpless and kept his mouth shut. \"One...two...\" Seeing that Lin Fei still refused to go away, the big man finally revealed his murderous intent. He tightened his grip on the knife and stabbed Lin Fei directly in the heart! \"Three! Go to hell!!\" Just when the big man thought the knife would pierce someone's chest like in the past, his right wrist was suddenly tapped by a finger. As if his wrist was shocked by electricity, he let go of his palm. When the knife fell, it was caught by Lin Fei's left hand. All this happened in the blink of an eye, and the two big men didn't even see what was going on before they realized that the knife had fallen into Lin Fei's hand. Fang Lian even covered his wrist and gritted his teeth in pain. Lin Fei threw the knife to the construction site in the distance, and once again stretched out his hand to the big man with an expressionless face. \"I think it's better for me to count. I'll count to three. If you don't give me the money, I'll pick your pockets myself.\" The two big men looked at each other with a hint of fear in their eyes. They were not idiots and had seen some masters on the road. Lin Fei's speed and skills just now were definitely not what an ordinary taxi driver should have! \"One...two...\" The two big men made eye contact, and both felt that one more thing would be better than one less thing. There was no need for the two of them to delay the main business assigned by the master for a small amount of money. \"Here! Let's give it!\" The square-faced man dug into his pocket and took out a few crumpled pieces of change. Lin Fei once again showed a harmless smile, \"Oh, wouldn't it be better if we did this earlier? Everyone is here to hang out and eat, so there is no need to make trouble...\" He took the money with a smile and started counting it. \"There are only one hundred and two here, and there is still eight hundred and eight to go.\" Lin Fei looked at the bald head behind him. The bald head touched it with his free hand, shook his head and said, \"I didn't bring any money.\" The square face said, \"This... friend, how about I owe you the debt first and then give you the rest of the money later?\" \"What kind of business is this? Have you ever heard of a taxi being paid on credit?\" \"Then what should I do?\" the bald head said impatiently. Lin Fei squinted his eyes and looked at the silver necklace on the bald head's chest, and said, \"Is that silver? Why don't you put that as a mortgage with me? Or if you don't want the money, give me the necklace.\" The bald head turned red and said angrily: \"Don't bully others too much! Don't think we are really afraid of you!\" \"Why are you angry again... aren't I discussing with you?\" Lin Fei muttered. \"This little brother, our patience has its limits. If you continue to waste our time like this, don't blame us for fighting against you,\" Fang Lian threatened. Lin Fei didn't mean to be intimidated, and continued to look at the two big men with a bit of difficulty, \"You really don't want to give me the necklace? Are there any other valuable items? Designer belts? Oh, by the way, are your earrings gold or silver...\" The anger in the two big men's hearts rose sharply. They felt that Lin Fei was staring at two dead people who couldn't fight back, and wanted to peel good things from the dead people. \"Too much bullying! Brother Zhong, let's kill him together!\" The bald man was furious. He put the sack on the ground, clenched his fists, and flexed his muscles. The bones in his body crackled like exploding beans. Fang Lian has also reached the limit of his patience. They are fooling around on the road. If they can endure being kicked in the nose and face, then don't fool around! What's more, the other party is just a taxi driver. Even if he has practiced some kung fu, he may not be their opponent! Seeing the two people clenching their fists and about to rush forward, Lin Fei said with a headache: \"Why do you have to do something again? Let's talk to him if we have something to say.\" \"Go and talk to the Lord of Hell!\" The square-faced man rushed forward and kicked him fiercely! Lin Fei moved out of the way with slight steps, and slapped the big man's calf with three fingers. The big man let out a scream, and his calf seemed to have been hit by something heavy and was about to split! At this time, the bald man took the opportunity to go behind Lin Fei and tried to hit Lin Fei on the back of the neck with an elbow. But Lin Fei's shoulders lowered, as if there were eyes behind his back, and he lightly reached back to catch the elbow, pulled it forward, and pushed it upward with his shoulder! \"Ouch!\" The bald man screamed like a slaughtering pig, and his elbow was broken by the force! One of the two big men couldn't stand firm, and the other lost an arm. It only took less than three seconds. The two of them looked at Lin Fei in horror. They couldn't believe that they were beaten to the ground by a taxi driver so easily.", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}